<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>JP Entrenamiento | Editar Producto</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net">
  <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.0/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">

  <style>
    :root{
      --jp-primary:#223a73;
      --jp-primary-2:#2f4f9a;
      --jp-accent:#7ea7ff;
      --jp-soft:#dfe8ff;
      --jp-bg:#f4f7fc;
      --jp-card:#ffffff;
      --jp-text:#1f2937;
      --jp-muted:#6b7280;
      --jp-success:#159447;
      --jp-danger:#d62839;
      --jp-warning:#d4a017;
      --jp-info:#0d6efd;
      --jp-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(27,47,95,.10);
      --jp-shadow-strong:0 20px 40px rgba(27,47,95,.14);
      --jp-radius:22px;
    }

    *{
      box-sizing:border-box;
    }

    body{
      margin:0;
      min-height:100vh;
      color:var(--jp-text);
      font-family:'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(126,167,255,.15), transparent 26%),
        radial-gradient(circle at top right, rgba(34,58,115,.12), transparent 28%),
        linear-gradient(180deg, #f8fbff 0%, var(--jp-bg) 100%);
      position:relative;
    }

    body::before{
      content:"";
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      background-image:url('/images/logo-jp.png');
      background-repeat:repeat;
      background-size:110px;
      opacity:.035;
      z-index:0;
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .contenido,
    .main-header,
    .footer{
      position:relative;
      z-index:1;
    }

    .main-header{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--jp-primary) 0%, var(--jp-primary-2) 100%);
      color:#fff;
      overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:0 12px 28px rgba(34,58,115,.18);
    }

    .main-header::before{
      content:'';
      position:absolute;
      inset:0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 12% 20%, rgba(255,255,255,.18), transparent 18%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 88% 16%, rgba(255,255,255,.12), transparent 18%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 65% 75%, rgba(255,255,255,.09), transparent 18%);
      pointer-events:none;
    }

    .header-inner{
      position:relative;
      z-index:2;
      padding:28px 0 24px;
    }

    .brand-wrap{
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:16px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      text-align:center;
    }

    .brand-logo{
      width:84px;
      height:84px;
      object-fit:cover;
      border-radius:50%;
      border:3px solid rgba(255,255,255,.85);
      background:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
      flex-shrink:0;
    }

    .brand-text h1{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.45rem, 3vw, 2.1rem);
      font-weight:800;
      letter-spacing:.2px;
    }

    .brand-text p{
      margin:.35rem 0 0;
      color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);
      font-size:.98rem;
    }

    .page-wrap{
      padding:28px 0 36px;
    }

    .hero-card{
      background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);
      border:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
      border-radius:28px;
      box-shadow:var(--jp-shadow-strong);
      backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
      overflow:hidden;
    }

    .hero-top{
      padding:24px 24px 18px;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(34,58,115,.05), rgba(34,58,115,.015));
    }

    .hero-head{
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:flex-start;
      gap:14px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .hero-title{
      margin:0;
      font-size:clamp(1.35rem, 2.4vw, 2rem);
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
    }

    .hero-subtitle{
      margin:.4rem 0 0;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.98rem;
      max-width:760px;
    }

    .hero-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:10px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .btn-header{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      gap:8px;
      text-decoration:none;
      border:none;
      border-radius:999px;
      padding:11px 18px;
      font-weight:700;
      transition:.18s ease;
      white-space:nowrap;
    }

    .btn-header-back{
      background:#fff;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
      box-shadow:0 10px 20px rgba(34,58,115,.10);
    }

    .btn-header-back:hover{
      transform:translateY(-1px);
      color:var(--jp-primary);
      background:#f3f6ff;
    }

    .btn-header-list{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, var(--jp-success), #20b45a);
      color:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(21,148,71,.18);
    }

    .btn-header-list:hover{
      color:#fff;
      transform:translateY(-1px);
      filter:brightness(1.03);
    }

    .hero-body{
      padding:22px 24px 24px;
    }

    .grid-two{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, .85fr);
      gap:18px;
      margin-bottom:22px;
    }

    .panel{
      background:#fff;
      border:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
      border-radius:24px;
      box-shadow:var(--jp-shadow);
      overflow:hidden;
      height:100%;
    }

    .panel-header{
      padding:18px 20px;
      border-bottom:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
      background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(34,58,115,.04), rgba(34,58,115,.01));
      display:flex;
      justify-content:space-between;
      align-items:center;
      gap:12px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
    }

    .panel-header h3{
      margin:0;
      font-size:1rem;
      font-weight:800;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
    }

    .panel-header p{
      margin:4px 0 0;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.9rem;
    }

    .panel-body{
      padding:18px;
    }

    .status-box{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap:14px;
      margin-bottom:18px;
    }

    .status-card{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,58,115,.03), rgba(126,167,255,.06));
      border:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:16px;
    }

    .status-label{
      margin:0 0 8px;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.84rem;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .status-value{
      margin:0;
      font-size:1.2rem;
      font-weight:900;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
      line-height:1.1;
    }

    .status-value.success{
      color:var(--jp-success);
    }

    .status-value.danger{
      color:var(--jp-danger);
    }

    .status-sub{
      margin:8px 0 0;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.82rem;
      line-height:1.35;
    }

    .form-grid{
      display:grid;
      grid-template-columns:repeat(12, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap:14px;
    }

    .field{
      grid-column:span 12;
    }

    .field.col-6{
      grid-column:span 6;
    }

    .field.col-4{
      grid-column:span 4;
    }

    .field.col-3{
      grid-column:span 3;
    }

    .field label{
      display:block;
      font-size:.86rem;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-weight:700;
      margin-bottom:7px;
    }

    .field input,
    .field textarea,
    .field select{
      width:100%;
      border:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.14);
      border-radius:14px;
      padding:13px 14px;
      background:#f8fbff;
      color:var(--jp-text);
      font-weight:600;
      outline:none;
      transition:.18s ease;
      resize:vertical;
    }

    .field textarea{
      min-height:110px;
    }

    .field input:focus,
    .field textarea:focus,
    .field select:focus{
      border-color:rgba(34,58,115,.28);
      background:#fff;
      box-shadow:0 10px 18px rgba(34,58,115,.08);
    }

    .field small{
      display:block;
      margin-top:6px;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.79rem;
      line-height:1.35;
    }

    .form-actions{
      display:flex;
      gap:10px;
      flex-wrap:wrap;
      margin-top:4px;
    }

    .btn-main{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:8px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, #234eb3, #1d3f92);
      color:#fff;
      border:none;
      border-radius:16px;
      padding:13px 18px;
      font-weight:800;
      text-decoration:none;
      box-shadow:0 10px 22px rgba(29,63,146,.18);
      transition:.18s ease;
    }

    .btn-main:hover{
      color:#fff;
      transform:translateY(-1px);
      filter:brightness(1.03);
    }

    .btn-secondary-soft{
      display:inline-flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      gap:8px;
      background:#eef3ff;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
      border:none;
      border-radius:16px;
      padding:13px 18px;
      font-weight:800;
      text-decoration:none;
      transition:.18s ease;
    }

    .btn-secondary-soft:hover{
      background:#e3ecff;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
    }

    .mini-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:14px;
    }

    .mini-card{
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,58,115,.03), rgba(126,167,255,.06));
      border:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
      border-radius:18px;
      padding:16px;
    }

    .mini-card-label{
      margin:0 0 8px;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.84rem;
      font-weight:700;
    }

    .mini-card-value{
      margin:0;
      font-size:1.28rem;
      font-weight:900;
      color:var(--jp-primary);
      line-height:1.1;
    }

    .mini-card-sub{
      margin:8px 0 0;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.83rem;
      line-height:1.35;
    }

    .tips-list{
      display:grid;
      gap:12px;
      margin-top:6px;
    }

    .tip-item{
      display:flex;
      align-items:flex-start;
      gap:12px;
      padding:14px;
      border-radius:18px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(34,58,115,.03), rgba(126,167,255,.06));
      border:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
    }

    .tip-icon{
      width:38px;
      height:38px;
      border-radius:12px;
      display:flex;
      align-items:center;
      justify-content:center;
      background:rgba(34,58,115,.10);
      color:var(--jp-primary);
      font-weight:800;
      flex-shrink:0;
    }

    .tip-text strong{
      display:block;
      color:#162542;
      margin-bottom:3px;
      font-size:.92rem;
    }

    .tip-text span{
      display:block;
      color:var(--jp-muted);
      font-size:.83rem;
      line-height:1.35;
    }

    .footer{
      margin-top:34px;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg, #dbe5ff, #c7d6ff);
      color:#30415f;
      text-align:center;
      padding:18px 12px;
      font-weight:600;
      border-top:1px solid rgba(34,58,115,.08);
    }

    @media (max-width: 1199px){
      .grid-two{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px){
      .header-inner{
        padding:22px 0 20px;
      }

      .brand-wrap{
        flex-direction:column;
        gap:12px;
      }

      .brand-logo{
        width:76px;
        height:76px;
      }

      .page-wrap{
        padding:20px 0 26px;
      }

      .hero-top,
      .hero-body{
        padding:18px 16px;
      }

      .hero-actions{
        width:100%;
      }

      .hero-actions .btn-header{
        flex:1 1 100%;
        justify-content:center;
      }

      .status-box{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .form-grid{
        grid-template-columns:1fr;
      }

      .field,
      .field.col-6,
      .field.col-4,
      .field.col-3{
        grid-column:span 1;
      }

      .form-actions{
        flex-direction:column;
      }

      .btn-main,
      .btn-secondary-soft{
        width:100%;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%
    const stockActual = Number(producto?.stock || 0);
    const stockMinimo = Number(producto?.stockMinimo || 0);
    const precioCompra = Number(producto?.precioCompra || 0);
    const precioVenta = Number(producto?.precioVenta || 0);
    const margen = precioVenta - precioCompra;
    const stockBajo = stockActual <= stockMinimo;
  %>

  <header class="main-header">
    <div class="container header-inner">
      <div class="brand-wrap">
        <img src="/images/logo-jp.png" alt="Logo JP" class="brand-logo">
        <div class="brand-text">
          <h1>JP Entrenamiento Personalizado</h1>
          <p>Edición de productos para ventas, stock y control del gimnasio</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container page-wrap contenido">
    <section class="hero-card">
      <div class="hero-top">
        <div class="hero-head">
          <div>
            <h2 class="hero-title">✏️ Editar producto</h2>
            <p class="hero-subtitle">
              Modifica la información del producto, ajusta precios, corrige el stock y deja el inventario
              siempre listo para vender sin errores.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="hero-actions">
            <a href="/productos" class="btn-header btn-header-back">← Volver</a>
            <a href="/ventas" class="btn-header btn-header-list">💰 Ir a Ventas</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-body">
        <div class="grid-two">
          <section class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <h3>Formulario de edición</h3>
                <p>Actualiza los datos del producto y guarda los cambios en el sistema</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel-body">
              <div class="status-box">
                <div class="status-card">
                  <p class="status-label">Estado del stock</p>
                  <h4 class="status-value <%= stockBajo ? 'danger' : 'success' %>">
                    <%= stockBajo ? 'Stock Bajo' : 'Stock OK' %>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="status-sub">
                    Actual: <strong><%= stockActual %></strong> unidad(es) ·
                    Mínimo: <strong><%= stockMinimo %></strong>
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div class="status-card">
                  <p class="status-label">Margen estimado</p>
                  <h4 class="status-value <%= margen >= 0 ? 'success' : 'danger' %>">
                    $<%= margen.toFixed(2) %>
                  </h4>
                  <p class="status-sub">
                    Diferencia entre precio de compra y precio de venta.
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <form action="/productos/editar/<%= producto._id %>" method="POST">
                <div class="form-grid">
                  <div class="field col-6">
                    <label for="nombre">Nombre del producto</label>
                    <input
                      type="text"
                      id="nombre"
                      name="nombre"
                      value="<%= producto.nombre %>"
                      required
                    >
                    <small>Usa un nombre claro para encontrarlo rápido al vender.</small>
                  </div>

                  <div class="field col-6">
                    <label for="categoria">Categoría</label>
                    <input
                      type="text"
                      id="categoria"
                      name="categoria"
                      value="<%= producto.categoria || '' %>"
                    >
                    <small>Ayuda a ordenar mejor el inventario del gimnasio.</small>
                  </div>

                  <div class="field">
                    <label for="descripcion">Descripción</label>
                    <textarea
                      id="descripcion"
                      name="descripcion"
                      placeholder="Ej: sabor, marca, presentación..."
                    ><%= producto.descripcion || '' %></textarea>
                    <small>Puedes detallar marca, sabor o presentación para identificarlo mejor.</small>
                  </div>

                  <div class="field col-3">
                    <label for="precioCompra">Precio de compra</label>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      step="0.01"
                      id="precioCompra"
                      name="precioCompra"
                      value="<%= precioCompra %>"
                    >
                    <small>Útil para medir ganancia.</small>
                  </div>

                  <div class="field col-3">
                    <label for="precioVenta">Precio de venta</label>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      step="0.01"
                      id="precioVenta"
                      name="precioVenta"
                      value="<%= precioVenta %>"
                      required
                    >
                    <small>Este valor impacta en ventas y reportes.</small>
                  </div>

                  <div class="field col-3">
                    <label for="stock">Stock actual</label>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      id="stock"
                      name="stock"
                      value="<%= stockActual %>"
                      required
                    >
                    <small>Actualízalo si hubo reposición o corrección.</small>
                  </div>

                  <div class="field col-3">
                    <label for="stockMinimo">Stock mínimo</label>
                    <input
                      type="number"
                      id="stockMinimo"
                      name="stockMinimo"
                      value="<%= stockMinimo %>"
                    >
                    <small>Sirve para alertas de reposición.</small>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-actions">
                  <button type="submit" class="btn-main">✅ Guardar Cambios</button>
                  <a href="/productos" class="btn-secondary-soft">📦 Volver al Listado</a>
                </div>
              </form>
            </div>
          </section>

          <aside class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <h3>Resumen del producto</h3>
                <p>Datos útiles para tomar decisiones rápidas</p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel-body">
              <div class="mini-list">
                <div class="mini-card">
                  <p class="mini-card-label">Producto</p>
                  <h4 class="mini-card-value"><%= producto.nombre %></h4>
                  <p class="mini-card-sub">
                    Edición activa del producto seleccionado.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mini-card">
                  <p class="mini-card-label">Precio de venta actual</p>
                  <h4 class="mini-card-value">$<%= precioVenta.toFixed(2) %></h4>
                  <p class="mini-card-sub">
                    Es el valor que se tomará al registrar una venta.
                  </p>
                </div>

                <div class="mini-card">
                  <p class="mini-card-label">Stock disponible</p>
                  <h4 class="mini-card-value <%= stockBajo ? 'danger' : 'success' %>"><%= stockActual %></h4>
                  <p class="mini-card-sub">
                    <% if (stockBajo) { %>
                      Este producto ya está en nivel bajo o crítico.
                    <% } else { %>
                      El stock actual está por encima del mínimo configurado.
                    <% } %>
                  </p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="tips-list">
                <div class="tip-item">
                  <div class="tip-icon">1</div>
                  <div class="tip-text">
                    <strong>Revisa el precio</strong>
                    <span>Un cambio aquí impacta directamente en ventas, caja y reportes.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tip-item">
                  <div class="tip-icon">2</div>
                  <div class="tip-text">
                    <strong>Corrige el stock</strong>
                    <span>Si entró mercadería o hubo error, ajústalo aquí para no vender mal.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tip-item">
                  <div class="tip-icon">3</div>
                  <div class="tip-text">
                    <strong>Define el mínimo</strong>
                    <span>Así el sistema marcará el producto cuando toque reponerlo.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="tip-item">
                  <div class="tip-icon">4</div>
                  <div class="tip-text">
                    <strong>Mantén ordenado</strong>
                    <span>Nombre, categoría y descripción claras facilitan vender más rápido.</span>
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </aside>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="footer">
    Todos los derechos reservados - Levi Prog.
  </footer>
</body>
</html>